<mxfile host="Electron" modified="2026-11-01T14:18:07.552Z" agent="5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) draw.io/17.4.2 Chrome/100.0.4896.60 Electron/18.0.1 Safari/537.36" version="17.4.2" etag="Qvq7-yh_c4szlsEFpkR7" type="device"><diagram name="High-Level Design" id="hld"><mxGraphModel dx="2147" dy="664" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="lgd" value="LEGEND&#10;1–10 = runtime request path (top -&gt; bottom)&#10;I1–I5 = ingestion (offline batch)&#10;Observability &amp; Evaluation are cross-cutting&#10;Cylinders = data stores;  dashed = async / optional" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="40" width="270" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="1. Chat UI (GET /)&#10;(👍/👎 feedback -&gt; POST /feedback)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="40" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="1. API clients (curl / apps)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="40" width="200" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="2. FastAPI endpoints:  POST /ask · /ask/stream (SSE) ·  POST /feedback ·  POST /session/reset ·  GET /health /ready /metrics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="120" width="760" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m1" value="3. Edge chain:  Request-ID middleware  |  Auth (X-API-Key — authenticates the CLIENT, not the user)  |  Rate limit (memory / redis)  |  Guardrails screen_input  |  AccessContext from X-User-Id / X-Roles / X-Sites&#10;⚠ TRUST BOUNDARY: the identity headers are caller-supplied, so &quot;X-Roles: admin&quot; is a full ACL bypass. ENABLE_ACL now requires TRUST_IDENTITY_HEADERS — a gateway must rebuild them from verified claims (OIDC / LDAP). Startup fails closed (validate_access), and networkpolicy.yaml is what makes the assertion true: default-deny, with only the gateway namespace allowed to reach port 8000." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="210" width="760" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o2" value="Semantic cache&#10;(cosine, skip under ACL / history)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="300" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o1" value="4. Orchestrator.run / stream&#10;(dispatch by AGENT_MODE)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontStyle=1" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="300" width="300" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="o3" value="Session memory&#10;(memory / redis, TTL, turn cap)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="630" y="300" width="190" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="G8xUulkAOTxG3u--sGCq-3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" parent="1" source="a1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="200" y="479"/></Array><mxPoint x="200" y="479" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="a1" value="5. Agent loop (tool-calling)&#10;LLM reasons + calls tools, loops" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="400" width="280" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a2" value="5. CRAG pipeline (LangGraph)&#10;rewrite -&gt; retrieve -&gt; grade -&gt; (retry) -&gt; generate" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="400" width="330" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="6. Agent tools:  search · lookup_fault_code · get_document_section · list_documents · query_cmms (CMMS connector)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="120" y="480" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r1" value="7. Retriever.hybrid_retrieve:  BM25 (in-proc) ∥ Qdrant dense -&gt; RRF -&gt; cross-encoder rerank -&gt; ACL boundary re-check&#10;ACL + freshness are pushed INTO the Qdrant query filter (payload-indexed), so top_k is filled with permitted neighbours instead of being truncated and then filtered&#10;While this process is behind the index, the sparse leg re-resolves each candidate's metadata from Qdrant and drops what the index no longer holds (see INDEX GENERATION)&#10;⚠ _embed_lock / _rerank_lock serialize embed + rerank per process: a worker can be saturated while looking CPU-idle — do not autoscale on CPU" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry y="560" width="640" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="l1" value="8. LLM provider layer&#10;anthropic / ollama / openai-compat&#10;+ retry / fallback / prompt cache" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="555" width="170" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p1" value="9. Post-generation:  ensure_citations (verify + Sources trailer)  |  faithfulness (LLM judge)  |  safety escalation  |  metrics + online-eval sample" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry y="666" width="700" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d1" value="Qdrant&#10;(dense vectors)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="740" width="130" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d2" value="chunks.json&#10;(BM25 source,&#10;snapshot ⚠)" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="220" y="740" width="130" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d3" value="Session store&#10;/ semantic cache" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="740" width="130" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d4" value="Feedback JSONL" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="740" width="130" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d5" value="Redis (opt)&#10;rate-limit / session" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="740" width="130" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ob" value="Cross-cutting observability:  structured JSON logs + request IDs · Langfuse tracing (env-gated: agent tool-call spans + token/generation usage, session grouping, feedback scores, eval-run traces) · Prometheus /metrics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fad7ac;strokeColor=#b46504;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="850" width="760" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ing" value="INGESTION (offline batch — scripts/ingest.py):&#10;I1  docs (pdf / scanned / docx / xlsx / md) -&gt; Dispatcher -&gt; parsers (Docling / Excel / Cloud / Markdown)&#10;I2  elements (text / table / figure)&#10;I3  contextual augment + figure vision-caption  (cached on the CONTENT hash only)&#10;I4  diff manifest keyed on the INDEX hash = content + ACL / version metadata&#10;      ⚠ an ACL-only edit must re-upsert. On a content-only hash nothing is upserted, so chunks.json carries the new ACL while Qdrant stays stale — sparse enforces ACLs and dense serves restricted chunks&#10;I5  incremental index (uuid5) -&gt; Qdrant + chunks.json  (+ ACL / versions sidecars, + index_meta generation)&#10;      + payload indexes on every filtered field, idempotently, EVERY run (create_collection is skipped for a collection that already exists)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="280" width="270" height="316" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cap" value="CAPACITY &amp; CONSTRAINTS (measured, synthetic 100k-chunk corpus — re-measure on the real corpus)&#10;&#10;Retrieval state per process:  chunk store 833 MB + BM25 doc_freqs 1002 MB = ~1.8 GB&#10;Plus reranker ~1.1 GB, embedder ~130 MB, torch runtime → ~3.5–4 GB/process&#10;&#10;Cold start ~90 s (tokenize ~54 s + BM25 build ~40 s), inside the FastAPI lifespan hook, so uvicorn accepts nothing until it finishes → k8s needs a startupProbe (liveness alone kills the pod at ~55 s)&#10;&#10;sparse_search 304 ms (3-term) – 733 ms (12-term): rank_bm25 scans every doc dict per query term&#10;&#10;⇒ ~50k chunks is the ceiling for this single-process shape; above it move sparse into Qdrant sparse vectors." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="706" width="270" height="354" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="evl" value="Evaluation:  RAGAS golden set (offline, Langfuse-traced) · CI retrieval-quality gate (recall@k, no Docker/keys)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;spacingLeft=8;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="616" width="270" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ec1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="c1" target="e1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ec2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="c2" target="e1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ee1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="e1" target="m1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="em1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="m1" target="o1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eo2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=block;endArrow=block;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="o1" target="o2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="eo3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=block;endArrow=block;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="o1" target="o3" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ea1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="o1" target="a1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ea2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="o1" target="a2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="etr" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="t1" target="r1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="310" y="540"/><mxPoint x="310" y="540"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ear" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="a2" target="r1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="635" y="530"/><mxPoint x="340" y="530"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="a1" target="l1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="260" y="460"/><mxPoint x="760" y="460"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="ea2l" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="a2" target="l1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="635" y="530"/><mxPoint x="735" y="530"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="erd1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="r1" target="d1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="-60" y="590"/><mxPoint x="-60" y="775"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="erd2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="r1" target="d2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="-40" y="604"/><mxPoint x="-40" y="720"/><mxPoint x="285" y="720"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="erp" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" parent="1" source="r1" target="p1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="epe" value="10. response / SSE" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="p1" target="m1" edge="1"><mxGeometry x="0.7263" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="840" y="670"/><mxPoint x="840" y="235"/></Array><mxPoint as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eind1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;" parent="1" source="ing" target="d1" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="860" y="470"/><mxPoint x="860" y="830"/><mxPoint x="30" y="830"/><mxPoint x="30" y="790"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="eind2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;entryX=0.696;entryY=0.007;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="ing" target="d2" edge="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="980" y="345"/><mxPoint x="850" y="345"/><mxPoint x="850" y="720"/><mxPoint x="311" y="720"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="gen" value="INDEX GENERATION — SERVING A CORPUS THE INDEX HAS MOVED PAST&#10;&#10;chunks.json is loaded once, at startup. Ingestion updates Qdrant as it goes and rewrites chunks.json only at the end, so for the whole duration of an ingest a serving process holds ACL labels and document statuses the index has already changed.&#10;&#10;⇒ ingestion claims a generation in index_meta.json BEFORE it touches Qdrant.&#10;&#10;While loaded generation ≠ on-disk generation:&#10;  • sparse resolves each candidate's metadata from Qdrant, not from memory&#10;  • a chunk Qdrant no longer holds is dropped — fail closed&#10;  ⇒ a revocation or a deletion applies at once, on both legs&#10;&#10;INDEX_RELOAD_POLL_S (60s) then rebuilds chunks.json + BM25 off the request path and swaps them as ONE reference — BM25 returns positions into the list it was built from, so a half-swapped pair resolves them against the wrong documents. That reload is what makes NEW documents keyword-searchable.&#10;&#10;⚠ it holds both corpora while it runs: peak RAM is ~2x the chunk store." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="1080" width="270" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="emb" value="WHY CHUNKS ARE SIZED IN TOKENS&#10;&#10;bge-small takes 512 tokens and truncates the rest in SILENCE. Measured tokens-per-word:&#10;  prose 1.23  |  table rows 1.57&#10;  codes + units 2.56  |  CJK 5.21&#10;&#10;A 4x spread, so no word target fits all content: the old 600-word window produced 743 tokens and lost 31% of every full chunk.&#10;&#10;Nothing failed — the text was still stored and still shown to the LLM, so only DENSE recall degraded, on the tail. BM25 indexes the full text, which is why it was invisible.&#10;&#10;Splits land on word boundaries (chunk text stays byte-identical) and the plan is re-measured with the real tokenizer. What still cannot fit is reported at ingest, not truncated quietly." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="280" width="280" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>